rue,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The Cisco SFP-10G-SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ Transceiver Module is a high-performance, short-range optical module designed for 10 Gigabit Ethernet applications. With an 850 nm wavelength, it delivers reliable connectivity over multimode fiber (MMF), making it the ideal solution for data centers, enterprise backbone links, and high-speed network infrastructures.</p><p><br></p><p>This compact, hot-swappable SFP+ module provides low power consumption, scalable reach, and Cisco-certified reliability, ensuring seamless integration into Cisco networking devices. Supporting Digital Optical Monitoring (DOM), it allows real-time diagnostics for better performance and proactive maintenance.</p><p><br></p><h3>Technical Specifications</h3><ul><li>Wavelength: 850 nm</li><li>Connector Type: Dual LC Duplex</li><li>Data Rate: 10 Gbps</li><li>Fiber Type: Multimode Fiber (MMF)</li><li>Reach: 26m (FDDI MMF), 300m (OM3), 400m (OM4)</li><li>Transmit Power: –7.3 dBm to –1.2 dBm</li><li>Receive Power: –9.9 dBm to –1.0 dBm</li><li>Power Consumption: ~1W typical</li><li>Power Supply: 3.3V DC</li><li>Operating Temp.: 0 °C to 70 °C (Standard)</li><li>Monitoring: Digital Optical Monitoring (DOM)</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Huawei 10G SFP+ Module 850nm (Multi Mode) 0.3km","href":"/huawei-10g-sfp-module-850nm-multi-mode-03km","now":"1,200৳","old":"1,300৳","single":""},{"name":"Fortinet FN-TRAN-SFP+SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ 850nm 300m SFP Module","href":"/fortinet-fn-tran-sfpsr-10gbase-sr-sfp-850nm-300m-sfp-module","now":"5,500৳","old":"6,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Intel 10G SFP+ 850NM Short Range Module 10GBASE-SR Optical Transceiver","href":"/intel-10g-sfp-850nm-short-range-module-10gbase-sr-optical-transceiver","now":"2,500৳","old":"3,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HPE Aruba 40G QS